OL,3,GNEWSAShot bus driver not intended
OL,4,Atarget, police say
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn innocent bus driver shot dead in
OL,7,Fsouth-west London was not the intended
OL,8,Ftarget and was "in the wrong place at
OL,9,Fthe wrong time", the Metropolitan
OL,10,FPolice have said.
OL,12,FAuguste-Marie Bile-aka Amoa was shot
OL,13,Foutside The Landor pub in Clapham
OL,14,Fshortly before 22:00 BST on 10 August.
OL,15,FThe 25-year-old died at the scene.
OL,17,FA 22-year-old man was arrested on
OL,18,Fsuspicion of murder on the same day and
OL,19,Flater released with no further action
OL,20,Ffollowing police enquiries. No further
OL,21,Farrests have been made.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
