OL,3,GNEWSAShot bus driver not intended
OL,4,Atarget, police say
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have released CCTV footage of
OL,7,Fthe moments following the shooting and
OL,8,FCrimestoppers has offered a #20,000
OL,9,Freward for information leading to
OL,10,Fidentification and conviction of those
OL,11,Fresponsible.
